n| Development & Testing     | Build AI models and perform safety tests            | AI Engineering       |\n| Deployment & Monitoring   | Deploy with monitoring tools and human oversight    | DevOps/AI Ops        |\n| Training & Awareness      | Conduct staff training and regular updates          | HR/Training          |\n\nWould you like a detailed checklist or example policies for any of these steps?'}

