| Model selection             | Select and design AI models         | AI Development           | Weeks 4-6    |
| Testing and validation       | Conduct thorough testing            | QA & AI Team             | Weeks 6-8    |
| Monitoring and governance    | Set up monitoring & policies        | IT Governance            | Week 9       |
| Employee training            | Train stakeholders in AI safety     | HR & Training            | Weeks 9-10   |
| Incident response planning   | Create response protocols            | Risk Management          | Week 10      |

